    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG One Player game with turn based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this spine-chilling indie horror game, players will step into the shoes of Hasumi, a brave and determined protagonist lost in the eerie and enigmatic world of Limbo. In a race against time to rescue your sister, Kioko, from the clutches of the malevolent Akumu, you will encounter and help other lost souls while engaging in turn-based battles with the Shinigami who lurk in Limbo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect amulets and objects to use in battle while helping other lost souls move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail?</p>",
